  "releaseNotes": "2.0.2\n      Fixes for navigation menu\n\n      2.0.1\n      Added filters, search and public links on \"Content type usages\" tab\n\n      2.0.0\n      Target framework is updated to .net 8.0\n\n      1.0.5\n      Added \"Created\" column to usages table.\n\n      1.0.4\n      Right place in menu for new admin UI, removed redundant dependancy\n\n      1.0.3\n      Fix issues with spacing in top menu, set fallback culture to EN with ignoring hosted site fallbacks\n\n      1.0.2\n      Set default required role to WebAdmins instead of Administrators\n\n      1.0.1\n      UI improvements for not active blocks\n\n      1.0.0\n      First release",
